{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33345","headline":"巴陵 · 欧阳玭","name":"巴陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤城向夕原，春入景初暄。\n绿树低官舍，青山在县门。\n楼台疑结蜃，枕席更闻猨。\n客路何曾定，栖迟欲断魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳玭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}